<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  -----			 O/N = -----</p>
<p>	    T/N =  3.41%			 T/N = -----</p>
<p>		   Nov 28, 1996			Nov 27, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  5.45%	1 month forward =  5.11%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  7.49%	2 month forward =  7.15%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  7.60%	3 month forward =  7.27%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  8.26%	4 month forward =  8.09%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  8.44%	5 month forward =  8.24%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  8.40%	6 month forward =  8.23%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
